  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/07/IMG_7396.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">32 fotos del inicio de la 2&ordf; de las &#39;Summer Fun Weeks&#39; de Kid&amp;Us Onda, &#39;School of English&#39; situada en la pla&ccedil;a de les Corts Valencianes, 9, en un entorno de plazas y jardines donde este verano ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as pueden disfrutar, siempre en ingl&eacute;s,&nbsp;durante&nbsp;el mes de julio con tem&aacute;ticas diferentes.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampus2ondfunweek16/img_7388.jpg\" alt=\"img_7388\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampus2ondfunweek16/img_7390.jpg\" alt=\"img_7390\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampus2ondfunweek16/img_7391.jpg\" alt=\"img_7391\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampus2ondfunweek16/img_7392.jpg\" alt=\"img_7392\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampus2ondfunweek16/img_7393.jpg\" alt=\"img_7393\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampus2ondfunweek16/img_7396.jpg\" alt=\"img_7396\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampus2ondfunweek16/img_7397.jpg\" alt=\"img_7397\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampus2ondfunweek16/img_7398.jpg\" alt=\"img_7398\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img